:"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KeoTW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0217a46c-65b8-41e3-8288-4c60440f86d5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"fixed","ts":"1636168568.206100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aAmU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"933f1304-6de3-43ad-8e90-df89c1dc7f56","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これディレクトリの有無の判定に使うのは……問題ないのか","ts":"1636168536.205800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Do/"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nisdirectory({directory})                                *isdirectory()*\n                結果は数値で、{directory}という名前のディレクトリが存在すれば\n                |TRUE|となる。{directory}が存在しないか、存在したとしても\n                ディレクトリではなかった場合には、|FALSE|が返される。文字列と\n                して解釈できるのならば{directory}の表現はどのようなもので\n                あってもかまわない。\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        GetName()-\u0026gt;isdirectory()\n```","ts":"1636168485.204500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f87ea8ce-9d68-4b6d-bb2b-bbee088efed3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h isdirectory()","ts":"1636168485.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tih"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bbcfe3c-6861-4da0-91e8-8c877590574a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"isdirectory…?","ts":"1636168479.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftd3M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c549ad7-65ea-4fc4-a462-f8d58c5f991a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あとは `glob()` で展開するとかぐらいしか思いつかないですね","ts":"1636168438.203200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cez"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9562372d-3a7f-4303-bfea-9c91774891d6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"dir版ってあります？","ts":"1636168328.201700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MI2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"808508a5-2f14-4346-b693-c0fefc6df50c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`filereadable()` かな","ts":"1636168291.201300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BxO75"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda00d9b-f683-44df-99c7-d8a7db6db41e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"findするの間違ってると思ってて、exist(file,dir)みたいなのってありましたっけ","ts":"1636168232.201100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KXq2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8572ed7c-a1ea-4826-a367-dbb36faa56e2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今更なんですがvim-layoutをgitプロジェクト単位で使えるようにして便利になりました\n```function! s:save_project_layout() abort\n  if isdirectory(getcwd() . '/.git')\n    call layout#save(getcwd() . '/.git/layout.json')\n  else\n    echoerr 'Not git project'\n  endif\nendfunction\n\nfunction! s:load_project_layout() abort\n  if filereadable(getcwd() . '/.git/layout.json')\n    call layout#load(getcwd() . '/.git/layout.json')\n  else\n    echoerr 'Undefined layout.json'\n  endif\nendfunction\n\ncommand! SaveProjectLayout call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;save_project_layout()\ncommand! LoadProjectLayout call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;load_project_layout()```\n\u003chttps://github.com/rbtnn/vim-layout\u003e","ts":"1636168183.200400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"rbtnn/vim-layout","id":1,"title":"rbtnn/vim-layout","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"5","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1636168563.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks"